      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنِ الْوَسِمَةِ فَقَالَ لَا بَأْسَ بِهَا لِلشَّيْخِ الْكَبِيرِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Ibn Mahboub, from Abdullah Bin Sinan who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the woad (a dyeing plant), so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘There is no problem with it for the old man, the aged’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. It is narrated from the narrator of the previous Hadith from ibn Mahbub from ‘Abd Allah ibn Sinan who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about applying Woad. He (the Imam) said, ‘It is not harmful to an old man .\" "
        ]
      }
